{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-04-14-join-via-link-in-a-md-a24851e138:u000002"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Dubai real estate agents, war, uncertainty market, March twenty twenty-six. My message to you is, there always in these times going to be a three different type of agents. One disappear and you know some of them already left. Another going to freeze and they're going to be an agent who keep moving and closing the deals. I inviting you to strong in sales community that I created on Telegram.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-04-14-join-via-link-in-a-md-a24851e138:u000002"}], "text": "The message is structured to first describe the context of uncertainty in the real estate market, then categorize types of agents, and finally invite the listener to join a developing community."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Use of Structuring Message", "topic": "message_structure"}, "content_hash": "8d81fa1aa743e0d361451393b952744ef61adc95cae0c7f22c97d24eac62cd6e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-04-14-join-via-link-in-a-md-a24851e138:expression:bff9c9b97e948709", "metadata_hash": "a30e65fa32f29e522e3bf674e8e4021a5356c9c1e77023dcb8d5c66af6640fc5", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-04-14T08:09:56Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "d42a4799cf28c6afecd0c4b0222d0b57533ec38731e2355490fc1cd0f5ca05b9", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-04-14-join-via-link-in-a-md-a24851e138", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DXGtdATgmSg/", "title": "Use of Structuring Message", "topic": "message_structure", "topic_slug": "message_structure"}
